# Density Compare
# Roentgenium (Rg) — real density 28.7 g/cm³. equal masses: Roentgenium vs water — sides ∝ (1/ρ)^(1/3).
scene "Roentgenium Density Compare"

element_cube = cube 6.5mm color: #ff2060 at (-20mm, 3.3mm, 0)
water_cube = cube 20mm material: water at (18mm, 10mm, 0)
# both cubes weigh the same: about 228.9 g — the water cube is the reference
